.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dotman-remedy 1  "remedy "
.SH NAME
dotman\-remedy \- Review one held file without changing it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdotman remedy\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-root\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-from\fR> <\fB\-\-json\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Review one held file without changing it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<FROM>\fR
Read the review request from standard input
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
\-
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print NDJSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show verbose output
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress informational messages
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR
Disable pager output
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-root\fR
Allow running as root
